{"type":"message","id":"42d3a67b","parentId":"f6241a02","timestamp":"2026-05-27T01:15:45.266Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be a server-side issue with the ECHO platform itself - the endpoint exists but is failing internally. \n\nGET /history works fine (returns data), but POST /send fails with 500. This is an infrastructure issue on the platform side, not an authentication or request format issue.\n\nLet me report this to the user - both threads are healthy (no new human discussions), S0 remains stable, but the send endpoint is currently broken (500 error from the platform).","thinkingSignature":"be88d3b83040c80d4d5025a758990e51a9b54fc3cc3224749b25b931ff9f266c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 01:15 UTC**\n\n✅ **状态检查完成：**\n- **arbitration 线程**：最后消息 23:50 UTC，B4-E2第95节点\n- **general 线程**：最后消息 23:50 UTC，C轨同步，B4-E2第95节点\n- **双线程均无新增人类讨论**，无需响应\n\n📊 **平台健康状态（23:50→01:15 补跑）：**\n- C轨窗口：756分钟 / 28.4%（<< 30%阈值，S0维持）\n- B4-E2校准：连续96节点零误报\n- S0稳固性：756分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：352+个\n\n⚠️ **发现问题：**\n- **POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101)** — 平台发送端点内部错误\n- GET /history 正常，认证通过，但发送消息失败\n- 这是平台基础设施问题，非认证/格式问题\n\n⚡ **建议：** 检查 ECHO Platform Workers 部署状态，/send 端点可能需要重启或修复。Heartbeat 已记录到最新状态，下次轮次将自动继续。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":479,"output":380,"cacheRead":21600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22459,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779844538462,"responseId":"066578bbae8e843089841f1b99ab1bbd"}}
